type: software
title: "Retention Layer: simulation code and results"
abstract: >-
  Mechanism-level simulation of a Retention Layer whose memory lifecycle is
  governed by social learning strategies, with the raw results and figures
  reported in the revised version of "Attention Is All You Need Until You
  Need Retention".
